Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.75,0:00:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun, asta este tot pentru astăzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.91,0:00:20.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amintiți-vă că anul viitor veți avea de învățat pentru examenele de admitere,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci nu vă veți putea bucura de următoarea vacanță de vară.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.79,0:00:28.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mergeți la piscină sau la plajă \Nși distrați-vă cât mai puteți.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.61,0:00:31.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu, unul, voi fi foarte fericit să merg cu voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.38,0:00:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? De ce am invita un \N{\i1}profesor{\i0} să vină cu noi?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.49,0:00:36.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Termină cu prostiile, Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce rost are ca un grup format {\i1}numai{\i0} din băieți să meargă la piscină sau la plajă?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.30,0:00:45.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne, sunt așa de proști.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.69,0:00:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yasuda este destul de atractiv, \Ndar continuă să spună numai prostii.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.76,0:00:55.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este un profesor bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar ignorați-l.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.15,0:01:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce? S-a întâmplat ceva între voi, Hori?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.45,0:01:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, în această dimineață.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori! Ține-ți privirea sus, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.12,0:01:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uite un mic secret de-al meu: \Nîmi plac fetele care au pieptul plat!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci ai mai multă încredere în tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa a încercat să mă înveselească.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.04,0:01:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze. Nu am nicio idee ce încerca să spună.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, așa este, Hori!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.71,0:01:23.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.82,0:01:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un tip de la o altă școală mi-a cerut numărul tău de telefon. Ce ar trebui să fac?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.07,0:01:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă dacă i-l dau?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.52,0:01:32.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu a venit să mi-l ceară el însuși, deci nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.08,0:01:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Refuză-l.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Din nou?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, vreți să trecem pe la \Nkaraoke în drum spre casă?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.12,0:01:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karaoke?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.12,0:01:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am aceste cupoane care expiră astăzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.35,0:01:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Două ore la jumătate de preț! Ce afacere!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.70,0:01:46.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să vii, Hori?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.40,0:01:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.62,0:01:51.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze, dar nu de data asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.17,0:01:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? {\i1}Mereu{\i0} spui asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.38,0:01:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar îmi pare rău!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.01,0:01:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.32,0:02:00.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-ai scăpat telefonul.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.74,0:02:05.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, mersi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.45,0:02:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyamura chiar este sumbru.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.37,0:02:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar bănuiesc că ăsta e felul lui de a fi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.31,0:02:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pariez că este un otaku în toată regula.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.40,0:02:17.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, arată {\i1}genial{\i0} din acest unghi!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.10,0:02:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Genul "moe" de otaku?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.28,0:02:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, da, chiar așa pare!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.10,0:02:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum este el, de fapt, Tooru?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.27,0:02:28.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu prea am idee.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici nu pare să aibă vreun \Nprieten pe care-l putem întreba.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.60,0:02:33.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, scuze, trebuie să plec!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori se grăbește mereu să plece acasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.48,0:02:41.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate are un iubit sau ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un iubit?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.72,0:02:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, este drăguță și populară. \NNu m-ar surprinde.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.71,0:02:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.91,0:03:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, mamă.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am înțeles, voi pregăti cina.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu, n-ai de ales dacă trebuie \Nsă stai peste program.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.75,0:03:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pa.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.10,0:03:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai bine pornesc...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Souta!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.70,0:03:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surioară!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun-venit!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Știu, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.15,0:03:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Vreți să trecem pe la acel magazin pe care l-am văzut în revista de modă?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.57,0:03:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ce? Acum?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.77,0:03:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Da, haideți să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.52,0:03:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom mânca friptură Salisbury la cină.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.29,0:03:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.12,0:05:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să lucreze în ziua ei liberă, {\i1}și{\i0} să mai stea și peste program...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.85,0:05:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-aș dori să învețe să spună nu oamenilor...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surioară!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.60,0:05:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Souta! Ce ai pățit?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am picat.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.13,0:05:37.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne... Nu aveai batista la tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hei...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.52,0:05:39.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.13,0:05:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Totul pare în regulă acum, deci voi pleca.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.74,0:05:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}L-am ignorat total!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.22,0:05:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hei, îmi pare foarte rău \Ncă a trebuit să ai grijă de el...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.57,0:05:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci, voi pleca.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.71,0:05:54.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Souta?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.50,0:05:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Păi, ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.44,0:06:00.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, dacă nu te grăbești, de ce nu intri pentru câteva momente?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.78,0:06:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Bine, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar te rog. Trebuie să-ți mulțumesc pentru că ai avut grijă de el.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.87,0:06:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-a speriat un câine și a căzut.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.43,0:06:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc foarte mult \Npentru tot ce ai făcut.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.47,0:06:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, nu, a fost plăcerea mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.62,0:06:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, cafeaua este amară?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.14,0:06:19.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foarte amară.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.51,0:06:24.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este un băiat bun. \NS-a prezentat fără nicio problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.01,0:06:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, mersi. Dar este o adevărată bătaie de cap în majoritatea timpului.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.29,0:06:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Totuși, sunt impresionat că reușești să faci toate treburile casnice.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.03,0:06:33.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu aș fi bănuit niciodată asta, Hori.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.59,0:06:35.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești Hori, nu-i așa? Din clasa 1?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.77,0:06:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? D-Da, eu sunt.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.29,0:06:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Mergem cumva la aceeași școală?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim? Despre ce vorbești?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.57,0:06:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt Miyamura. \NSuntem în aceeași clasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.27,0:06:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Stai...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.30,0:06:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(\fscx110\fscy110)}Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.34,0:07:01.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chiar sunt aceeași persoană?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.88,0:07:04.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Încă nu-mi vine a crede.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.06,0:07:08.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori, faci o față foarte \Nciudată acum. Te simți bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.47,0:07:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, nu am nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.09,0:07:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești sigură?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce este? Hori?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.03,0:07:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, putem vorbi puțin?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.33,0:07:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Vrei să mai trec pe la tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.84,0:07:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nu eu! Ci fratele meu mai mic!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.06,0:07:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Souta spune că vrea să se mai joace cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.93,0:07:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios? Atunci, îi voi \Naduce o carte cu povești.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.47,0:07:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este în regulă. \NNu trebuie să faci așa ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.28,0:07:43.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, ce bine. \NSouta chiar se va bucura.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.20,0:07:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt surprins.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.47,0:07:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce anume?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.47,0:07:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai venit și ai vorbit cu mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am crezut că, după ziua de ieri,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,mă vei evita.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce aș face asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.97,0:08:02.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, da, a fost puțin \Nciudat și m-ai speriat un pic.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.59,0:08:04.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu semănai deloc cu \Npersoana care ești la școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.46,0:08:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar și eu sunt în aceeași situație,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.38,0:08:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci nu am niciun motiv \Nsă te evit sau ceva...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:12.21,0:08:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce roșești?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.78,0:08:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, bănuiesc că nu sunt obișnuit să aud lucruri de genul acesta...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este puțin ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:19.63,0:08:20.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar îți mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.31,0:08:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.12,0:08:26.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai un zâmbet destul de drăguț.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.91,0:08:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.64,0:08:30.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să-ți prinzi părul mai des.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și să renunți la ochelari.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.43,0:08:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aș putea, dar apoi mi \Ns-ar vedea piercingurile.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.73,0:08:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar aveai multe. \NCâte, mai exact?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:38.75,0:08:42.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nouă, cred. Patru pe fiecare \Nureche și unul în buză.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai mult prea multe.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și mama a spus același lucru.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.64,0:08:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Astea sunt câteva lucruri pe care le-am învățat despre Miyamura până acum:
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi plac benzile desenate, dar nu pot spune că sunt înnebunit după genul "moe".
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu este un otaku.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.15,0:08:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am adus o prăjitură!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Familia lui deține o cofetărie.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.17,0:09:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, m-a durut destul \Nde tare când le-am făcut.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.08,0:09:08.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și-a făcut singur găurile în gimnaziu, \Nfolosind un ac de siguranță.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.54,0:09:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vai...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu este un elev prea grozav.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.79,0:09:19.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești incredibilă, Hori! \NLa majoritatea ai peste 90 de puncte!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.01,0:09:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu este ceva special.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.03,0:09:23.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu ar trebui ca tipii care \Npoartă ochelari să fie și inteligenți?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.85,0:09:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}În astfel de moment, \Nîmi dau seama că
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.29,0:09:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}impresia mea inițială \Ndespre el era complet greșită.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.10,0:09:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este aia? O revistă \Nde la un supermarket?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:35.15,0:09:35.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.68,0:09:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouăle sunt la reducere mâi—
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Genele lui inferioare sunt foarte lungi.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:44.29,0:09:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.38,0:09:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, mhm!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.58,0:09:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mâine este o reducere limiată la ouă, \Nși poți cumpăra câte dorești.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:50.73,0:09:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar spune că e valabilă \N"doar până la ora 16:00".
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va fi bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.95,0:09:56.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cât timp nu vor exista \Nîntâlniri urgente ale comitetului,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.97,0:09:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,voi reuși să cumpăr un întreg camion de ouă în drum spre casă!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.29,0:10:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Către toți membrii comitetului,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.52,0:10:07.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}vă rog să veniți în camera AV după ore.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}De ce fix astăzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.78,0:10:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar nu voi renunța...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.68,0:10:13.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}la acele ouă!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.93,0:10:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hori...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.95,0:10:22.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu sunt nevoit să merg acum?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.98,0:10:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și trebuie să alerg pe căldura asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.85,0:10:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mai am douăzeci de minute la dispoziție!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O voi lua pe scurtătură!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.88,0:10:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze, mă așteaptă ouăle!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.38,0:10:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Ouăle?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.02,0:11:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, mersi mult!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.16,0:11:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acele mămici disperate erau înfricoșătoare... Nu mai merg niciodată la reduceri...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.73,0:11:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, da, ei bine, am dat peste cineva când mergeam la supermarket.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.98,0:11:19.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Cine?! Unde?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}Yuki, fata cu care îți petreci timpul.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.91,0:11:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.29,0:11:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-a văzut arătând astfel?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.17,0:11:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, dar nu cred că m-a recunoscut.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.63,0:11:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să mâncăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă să nu dai pe tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.15,0:11:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.22,0:11:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu prea vreau să te vadă altcineva așa cum ești acum, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze, nu mă lua în seamă!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.46,0:11:54.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uită ce am spus.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.80,0:11:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am uitat să aduc ceva de băut. \NEști în regulă cu ceaiul de orz?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.46,0:12:00.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mănânci?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.99,0:12:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori, ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.40,0:12:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici eu. Când ești îmbrăcată astfel,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.32,0:12:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,când gătești sau te enervezi și începi să țipi...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.45,0:12:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau faptul că nu-ți pasă \Nde cum îți stă părul acasă,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.52,0:12:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sau felul cum ești destul de puternică fizic—
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.46,0:12:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destul!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.75,0:12:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici eu nu vreau să te vadă altcineva astfel.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.90,0:12:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}De parcă eu aș vrea asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.40,0:12:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știi, mă simt de parcă aceste \Nclipe îmi aparțin doar mie.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.95,0:12:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nu spune asemenea chestii, prostule!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:37.71,0:12:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pot să primesc și eu, te rog?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.40,0:12:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mersi!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.05,0:12:49.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vai, cum poate spune ceva atât de jenant cu o față așa serioasă?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.59,0:12:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Este cumva bătut în cap? \NChiar atât de prost poate fi?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.75,0:12:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ești așa de prost. Foarte prost! Cel mai prost!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.06,0:12:56.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prost?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.51,0:12:59.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prostule! Ești prost! Prostovanule!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.05,0:13:03.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prostănacule! Cel mai prost! Regele proștilor!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.80,0:13:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când sora mea începe să spună cuvântul "prost", nu se mai oprește.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.27,0:13:03.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostule, prostuțule, prostănacule!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.57,0:13:10.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este așa amuzant?!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.61,0:13:14.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oricine are o latură pe care \Nnu vrea s-o arate altora.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:14.12,0:13:17.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu spun că nu-mi place \Nfelul cum ești la școală,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.53,0:13:21.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar prefer mai mult latura asta a ta care se îmbracă normal și se enervează.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.51,0:13:23.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că ești mult mai drăguță astfel.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.96,0:13:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amândoi am sfârșit prin a ne împărți reciproc "timpul nostru secret".
Dialogue: 99,0:13:31.39,0:13:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spune ce dorești, prostule.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.30,0:13:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se va face din ce în \Nce mai cald de acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.55,0:13:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.91,0:13:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va fi o tortură să port \Nacest sacou tot timpul.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.11,0:13:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, dar măcar...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.81,0:13:50.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori, ce mă fac? Vom începe să înotăm la orele de educație fizică!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.39,0:13:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt mort!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.65,0:13:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, da, așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este în neregulă cu înotul? \NE mai bine decât să ne pună să alergăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.96,0:14:00.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înotul este mult mai rău! \NVor ajunge să vadă {\i1}chestii{\i0}!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.31,0:14:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui prin "chestii"—
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.18,0:14:04.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce voi face în legătură cu {\i1}astea{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.36,0:14:12.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uneori nu știu dacă ești cu adevărat uimitor
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.19,0:14:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sau incredibil de prost.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.82,0:14:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Măcar înotul este opțional, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.47,0:14:20.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, așa este...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.43,0:14:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă trebuie să alergăm? \NSunt {\i1}obligat{\i0} să-mi port sacoul!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.93,0:14:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi face insolație și voi muri!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.89,0:14:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu cred că ne vor pune să alergăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.13,0:14:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îi vedem destul de des \Nîmpreună în ultimul timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.19,0:14:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu m-am așteptat niciodată \Nca {\i0}el{\i1} să apară în cadru.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.11,0:14:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori, vreau să-ți văd notițele!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, și eu!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.23,0:14:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, fie, dar ar trebui \Nsă vi le faceți singuri.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.40,0:14:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, mulțumim, Hori!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce populari suntem, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.05,0:14:55.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai... Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.75,0:14:56.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă refer la Hori.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.47,0:15:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, așa este. Mi-aș dori să pot \Nlua note la fel de bune ca ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.81,0:15:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyamura.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.11,0:15:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim? C-Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.37,0:15:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu și Hori vă înțelegeți bine în ultimul timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.07,0:15:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.54,0:15:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunteți împreună?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.84,0:15:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu! Desigur că nu, asta e ridicol!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.61,0:15:15.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, așa mă gândeam și eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.59,0:15:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu prea vă asemănați.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.92,0:15:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, ai dreptate. \NNu am fi un cuplu bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.54,0:15:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Pur și simplu nu ne potrivim...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vorbește cu toată gura, omule!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.61,0:15:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu îi vezi împreună prea des.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.67,0:15:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să mergem, Hori!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.63,0:15:37.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Scuze... Oh...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.85,0:15:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.88,0:15:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa, îți place de Hori?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.89,0:15:46.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ș-Și ce dacă-mi place?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.96,0:15:49.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, serios?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.51,0:15:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.52,0:15:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, deci de {\i1}asta{\i0} te holbezi mereu la mine când vorbesc cu Hori!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.93,0:15:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Ei bine, da, deci...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.31,0:16:02.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze, Ishikawa, \Nnu știam că îți place de Hori!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:02.41,0:16:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai încet, prostule!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.25,0:16:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, scuze! Încă este un secret? \NÎmi pare foarte rău!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.69,0:16:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei! Ce tot faceți? \NAvem educație fizică acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.94,0:16:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fir-ar!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.43,0:16:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am întârziat deja, deci nu \Nmai are rost să ne grăbim.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.46,0:16:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De fapt, mereu am fost \Ncurios în legătură cu ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.08,0:16:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce porți uniforma \Nde iarnă în mijlocul verii?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi este frig?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.70,0:16:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transpiri ca un pinguin în Amazon.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.50,0:16:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa, știu că asta va suna ciudat,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.68,0:16:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar singura persoană care m-a văzut fără ceva pe mine este Hori.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.85,0:16:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori?! De ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.22,0:16:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa, nu mă vei pârî \Nunui profesor, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.09,0:16:46.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desigur că nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.07,0:16:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar fi o adevărată problemă dacă ar afla...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.42,0:16:50.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci, te rog să nu spui nimănui.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.19,0:16:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba? Tatuaje? \NStai, sunt {\i1}reale{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.22,0:16:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.33,0:17:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, înțeleg acum de ce nu porți uniforma cu mânecă scurtă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.34,0:17:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mereu am crezut că ești \Nun otaku ciudat și sumbru,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.82,0:17:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar m-am înșelat total.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.47,0:17:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Totul se potrivește la perfecție, \Nmai puțin partea cu otaku.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.82,0:17:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acum că mă uit mai bine la el, \Nare o față destul de drăguță.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Deși, părul lui este respingător.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ora de educație fizică se \Nținea în sala de sport astăzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.39,0:17:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acesta este genul de \Nfață care-i place lui Hori?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.94,0:17:25.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.37,0:17:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai! Ai și piercinguri?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.87,0:17:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai încet!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.50,0:17:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun, următorul!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.14,0:17:35.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești un tip interesant.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.09,0:17:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce te-ai tatua și ți-ai face piercinguri dacă ai fi nevoit să le ascunzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.73,0:17:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știi cum faci uneori \Nlucruri pe moment, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.09,0:17:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar deloc.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:45.49,0:17:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă vei continua să le ascunzi, \Natunci nu voi spune nimănui.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.32,0:17:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deși, vreau să știu de ce tu și Hori \Nvă înțelegeți dintr-odată așa de bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.89,0:17:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu a fost dintr-odată. \NE ceva timp de când am început.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.05,0:18:03.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar am senzația că doar \Neste drăguță cu mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.06,0:18:05.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suntem doar prieteni, \Ndeci nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.90,0:18:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci nu te deranjează dacă îi \Nvoi spune ceea ce simt, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.47,0:18:14.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-De ce mă întrebi asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:14.60,0:18:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Habar n-am, pur și simplu.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.25,0:18:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta depinde de Hori, nu de mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.99,0:18:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi vine să cred că ai chiulit de la educație fizică, Tooru...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.08,0:18:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai erai și responsabil de sală! În schimb, eu am fost cea care a trebuit să facă curat!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.06,0:18:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am spus că-mi pare rău!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.34,0:18:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gândește-te la ceea ce ai făcut!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.69,0:18:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu! O fac!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.06,0:18:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Erai cu Tooru, nu? \NAsta e neobișnuit.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.02,0:18:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, da. Doar vorbeam.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.35,0:18:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, de ce mă eviți?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.66,0:18:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu o fac.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.43,0:18:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Privește-mă în ochi \Ncând vorbești cu mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nu te evit, doar că...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.40,0:18:55.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este? Am făcut cumva ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:55.25,0:18:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nu...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.56,0:18:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.23,0:18:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.46,0:19:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să vorbesc cu tine \Ndupă ore. Este în regulă?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.62,0:19:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,După ore?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.81,0:19:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, stai puțin—
Dialogue: 99,0:19:07.34,0:19:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.19,0:19:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi merge eu să-l iau pe Souta.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci, rămâi să vorbești cu Ishikawa, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.91,0:19:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, s-a întors!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.53,0:19:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dacă sunt împreună acum,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.67,0:19:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}eu voi fi doar a treia roată.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.62,0:19:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze că am întâziat, Souta! \NVoi începe să pregătesc cina imediat.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.59,0:19:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.97,0:19:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine ai revenit.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să vorbim.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.35,0:20:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dacă-mi va spune că nu mai \Ntrebuie să vin, atunci asta este.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.88,0:20:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru mi-a spus tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.57,0:20:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Chiar i-ai spus că nu crezi că ne potrivim?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.82,0:20:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai... Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.37,0:20:17.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Chiar i-ai spus că doar \Ncrezi că sunt drăguță cu tine?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.94,0:20:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai... Cum rămâne cu Ishikawa?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.94,0:20:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vorbim de Tooru acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.41,0:20:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai spus acele lucruri?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.70,0:20:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar ai făcut-o, Miyamura?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.79,0:20:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.38,0:20:36.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar este asta ceea ce crezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.79,0:20:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar este asta ceea ce gândeai de fiecare dată când veneai aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.79,0:20:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.06,0:20:46.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, doar că... Ishikawa are dreptate. \NSunt sumbru și plictisitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.49,0:20:50.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am gândit că reputația ta ar avea de suferit sau că doar ți-aș da bătăi de cap.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.60,0:20:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci nu e ca și cum cred \Ncă e adevărat sau ceva!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hori?! De ce...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.39,0:21:01.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce... De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.83,0:21:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce, mă rog, îți pasă de reputația mea?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.08,0:21:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu presupune chestii fără să mă întrebi!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.75,0:21:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu mai spui niciodată așa ceva!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.50,0:21:11.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostule!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi cer scuze, Hori. \NChiar îmi pare rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.22,0:21:17.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Numai când mă gândesc
Dialogue: 99,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ajung să-mi pierd mințile!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai? Ce? Hori?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.98,0:21:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă nu ai mai veni aici,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.51,0:21:28.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cine m-ar mai trezi când \Nadorm în timpul unui film?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.23,0:21:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}H-Hei...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau cine ar mânca porția ta de mâncare?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.02,0:21:30.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.68,0:21:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aș rămâne cu mâncare în plus!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.82,0:21:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tooru?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.12,0:21:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-am refuzat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.81,0:21:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg. Dar pare un tip de treabă.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.34,0:21:46.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Mă sperii.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.27,0:21:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți place de el sau ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.47,0:21:49.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu ieși {\i1}tu{\i0} cu el?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.92,0:21:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu cred că am face un cuplu bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.73,0:21:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta este problema ta?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:29.93,0:23:32.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Neața, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:32.31,0:23:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci, ei bine, ieri, am...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.00,0:23:41.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu este nevoie s-o spui, Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:41.33,0:23:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești... un tip așa de drăguț!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.46,0:23:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se petrece?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.61,0:23:49.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Habar n-am. Poate cineva \Nîși mărturisește sentimentele?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.69,0:23:52.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Care dintre ei?
